Subject: [PATCH 10/17] Couch Party: picked portraits move to each player's
 split-screen spot

Once everyone has picked, each portrait moves to the centre of where that
player's view will be (from the split-screen setting and monitors) instead
of the stock 1-4 player spots. Also stops players 5-8 reading past the
stock position table.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qq7B1uqfWVWykYRDDMiuXa
